title: "The ARC Principle and Eden Protocol: Recursive Intelligence Scaling and Embedded AI Alignment"
abstract: "A 28-document research programme, twenty-six papers and two supporting documents, on recursive capability and alignment scaling, architecture-dependent alignment, blinded evaluation of AI safety, and the Eden Protocol stakeholder-care intervention."
